<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>HideNowPlaying</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开启后，锁屏音乐卡/实时活动卡支持左滑隐藏并同步隐藏灵动岛；暂停后继续播放会自动恢复显示。关闭后左滑手势不再生效，若已隐藏会立即恢复。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.aha.hidenowplaying</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>swipeHide</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>锁屏左滑隐藏</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.aha.hidenowplaying/prefschanged</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>卡片背景透明度：只淡化白色背景板，文字/封面不受影响。1.0 = 不透明(功能关闭)，0.05 = 接近全透。拖动即时生效。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>0.55</real>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.aha.hidenowplaying</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>bgAlpha</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.05</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>1</real>
			<key>isVertical</key>
			<false/>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.aha.hidenowplaying/prefschanged</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>罩层透明模式：开启后不改写系统材质，改用自建模糊罩层实现透明（更稳定，推荐保持开启）；关闭则回退经典直接改 alpha 方式。原 HideNowPlaying.cover 文件开关已退役，装新版后可删除该文件。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.aha.hidenowplaying</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>coverMode</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>罩层透明模式</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.aha.hidenowplaying/prefschanged</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
